# Change Management Procedure

Procedure describing how changes are raised, approved, implemented and reviewed. It also states which roles may request and approve production access. The document carries no signature block.

## Scope reference — CONT-11: Changes approved before implementation
Requirement addressed: Every production change is approved by a named approver before it is implemented.

- Change reference: Recorded in EV-007 (Change Management Procedure).
- Approval date: 2026-04-14.
- Implementation date: 2026-04-14.

## Scope reference — CONT-15: Segregation of duties on production access
Requirement addressed: Requesting, approving and granting production access are performed by different roles.

- Process description: Recorded in EV-007 (Change Management Procedure).
- Roles separated: Recorded in EV-007 (Change Management Procedure).
- Review date: 2026-04-14.
- Approver name: verified in meeting record.

